<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran troops have continued airstrikes and ground assaults against Haitian gang leaders, destroying Jeff's luxury mansion and demolishing another stronghold, killing about 20 gang members. Haiti formalised a security pact with El Salvador and deployed Salvadoran forces who are now engaged in combat with gangs in Port-au-Prince, prompting both supportive and oppositional street protests. The United Nations warned that anti-gang operations must prioritise civilian protection, while the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/19/why-are-bukeles-salvadoran-troops-in-haiti-and-what-have-they-achieved?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/18/bukele-confirms-airstrike-on-haitian-gang-leader-jeffs-luxury-mansion&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPRmpWdlJLb2RUTlBvVFpSSkJDVUJyaVBFZXY2dWthaWYxbEZYaFZ3ejVEbDY5NkpBRWNncHZYaDBvaGRRcjVFUXBZYVB3SEJDcXliV0ZSTlQzVmc2bEhhZzEtenVzVFdIZEFrSllmUFhnNlVDel9QOGl4Nl9TQTB0Zzg0XzFaV2c5UlB4ak1B?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPSHFuX0hOblhOSGtoT0kzc3hvTlBsQ3Q2cVB5aHNldlFMOTNiOWZjNmRaVk9nc3lfNWI4RUhLZWlvVGNrQjhOVno5Yy1TRjRmamdDSWI4TzJUNFl4THhFS1lMX09iTXZyU18xc1VHNnFVeTIwb2RrUWVVQ3FBRXFEMTlpUm05cFZGVGZOLXY5OHFtMDVtWEgybmdOZkRoS2hqYUhzWG9NSUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1rak13TzB4RDI2dHVkbUx1NC15STNuUGY4VzRhaFJaOUNsbkJQZ2lKMGVqaVFCRGc4Tko5Q2w1T2RxRkhoa0daNTJfM2ZFN3BMOUJmZ19Fa3M1ZzgwMFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&